Modifications in this fork, starting from v1.2.8:

  - Fix SENTINEL MASTERS parsing under RESP2, which made the sentinel
    master-name auto-discovery always return an empty list.
  - Complete the missing go.sum checksums so a fresh clone builds.
  - Add a native arm64 Dockerfile for the web/server mode.
  - Pin the Go toolchain version used for builds (macOS 26+ requires a
    recent Go toolchain to produce loadable binaries).
  - Rebrand the application to KVPilot (name, bundle identifier, UI).

